OL,3,AThe hotel booking mix-up that could
OL,4,Afree mushroom murderer
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast July, hundreds descended on
OL,7,FAustralia's Gippsland region from
OL,8,Faround the country for the most
OL,9,Fexciting event on the annual table
OL,10,Ftennis calendar.
OL,12,FBut as elite players vied for medals at
OL,13,Fthe national championships, one of the
OL,14,Fbiggest criminal cases in the nation's
OL,15,Fhistory - that of mushroom murderer
OL,16,FErin Patterson - was unfolding just a
OL,17,Ffew kilometres away.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
