OL,3,AThe hotel booking mix-up that could
OL,4,Afree mushroom murderer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis tournament inadvertently became
OL,7,Fpart of a perfect storm which the
OL,8,Ftriple killer's lawyers are now arguing
OL,9,F"fatally undermined" the fairness of
OL,10,Fher trial.
OL,12,FThe jury which condemned Patterson to
OL,13,Fprison were supposed to be isolated -
OL,14,Fsheltered from the frenzy surrounding
OL,15,Fthe case while they deliberated.
